### Testing with Postman, Thunder Client or the REST Client extension
### Start any server from this folder first, e.g. ../09-crud-array-create-read.js
### Install the "REST Client" extension in VS Code, then click "Send Request" above each block.

### 1. List all jobs (GET)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/jobs

### 2. Create a job (POST with a JSON body)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company": "Acme",
  "ctc": 8
}

### 3. Update job 1 (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/jobs/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ctc": 10
}

### 4. Delete job 1 (DELETE)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/jobs/1
